    // whenever you add a new Shortcut above.
    //
    // Why a hand-curated list and not auto-enumeration: Qt's
    // Shortcut element has no introspection API; even if it did,
    // a chord doesn't carry its own description. The registry is
    // the *documentation*, the Shortcut elements are the
    // *behavior*. Manual sync is the cost of having both in one
    // place.
