                        // ═══ TERMINAL FIND BAR (v0.1.349) ═══
                        //
                        // Scrollback search. Appears at the top of the
                        // terminal pane when active. The bar is height
                        // 0 when hidden so it doesn't occupy layout
                        // space.
                        //
                        // Activation:
                        //   - Ctrl+F when not in alt-screen TUI (vim/
