                                // in Keys.onPressed for these combos, but by
                                // then onShortcutOverride had already
                                // returned e.accepted=true (in the Ctrl-letter
                                // branch below), which means Qt had already
                                // BYPASSED the Shortcut and was delivering
                                // the key as a regular keypress. Returning
                                // false in onPressed at that point did
                                // nothing — the Shortcut was never going to
                                // get the event.
