                            // escape (CSI 1;2A / 1;2B) to the app instead of a plain
                            // arrow — gitui uses Shift+Up/Down for its jumps, helix
                            // for extend-selection. Modified arrows are always CSI
                            // form (the modifier forces it) regardless of DECCKM, so
                            // a literal write is correct. Shift+Left/Right stay as the
                            // tab switch (vertical = app, horizontal = tabs).
                            Keys.onUpPressed: function(e){
