            // classifier. The 200ms timer interval gives QML one
            // render frame so the popup paints before classifying
            // (else the user sees a flash of an empty popup).
            recognizedText = text
            // Mirror to root-level recent-utterance signal so the
            // blocks drawer's relevance-slider sees it too.
