        // v0.1.709 (scroll perf): cache of (outlineIdx, y) for the rendered
        // doc's mdhdg anchors. Built ONCE per page load via a single tree walk
        // (collect_mdhdg_ys), not re-walked per scroll. _readerActiveSection
        // then just scans this small array — O(anchors) with no mapToItem tree
