                    // v0.1.427: in-graph walk path. Draws a glowing
                    // polyline through the session-walk pages in
                    // order (overlaid on the nodes/edges themselves,
                    // per the user's "overlay it on the nodes and
                    // verts" ask). The traversed portion is bright;
                    // the rest is faint. A pulsing ring marks the
                    // current node. Same coord transform as
